\newlabel{fig:training_pipeline}{{3}{7}{\textbf {Training pipeline and comparators.} All methods branch from SFT. \textsc {PPO} and \textsc {GRPO} are \textbf {online} methods requiring reward models/functions. \textsc {DPO} is an \textbf {offline} preference method. SwiPO stacks on preference optimization with \textbf {explicit instruction-conditioning} and a \textbf {mandatory KL anchor}.\relax }{figure.caption.21}{}}
